          "docs": "<p> The <code>DeleteHIT</code> operation is used to delete HIT that is no longer needed. Only the Requester who created the HIT can delete it. </p> <p> You can only dispose of HITs that are in the <code>Reviewable</code> state, with all of their submitted assignments already either approved or rejected. If you call the DeleteHIT operation on a HIT that is not in the <code>Reviewable</code> state (for example, that has not expired, or still has active assignments), or on a HIT that is Reviewable "
